WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:10.414
In tutorial 2.4, you'll add a
second website to your company.

00:00:10.464 --> 00:00:12.418
Each one gets its own dashboard.

00:00:13.418 --> 00:00:16.643
First, click the website switcher
at the top of the sidebar,

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:21.400
then choose Add a website. Only
owners and admins can add a website.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:27.054
Type the website's address, then pick its
main country, where its customers search.

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:34.463
Next, say what the website does, and
add what it sells, one item at a time.

00:00:37.354 --> 00:00:40.504
Then describe its customers,
and choose the main goal,

00:00:40.554 --> 00:00:42.758
like getting leads and enquiries.

00:00:44.854 --> 00:00:49.229
You can also add a tone of voice, a
call to action, real business facts,

00:00:49.279 --> 00:00:51.047
competitors and brand names.

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:57.746
Click Add website, and Alaventra takes you
straight to proving the website is yours.

00:01:00.858 --> 00:01:04.833
Your new website is now in the website
switcher, with its own dashboard,

00:01:04.883 --> 00:01:07.933
marked unverified until
you prove it's yours.

00:01:07.983 --> 00:01:13.213
Next for every website: verify ownership,
connect your data, and start tracking.

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:18.978
So, open the switcher, fill in the address
and business, add the extras you know,

00:01:19.028 --> 00:01:20.479
and click Add website.

00:01:21.433 --> 00:01:27.648
Your new website is added. Next, use the
step-by-step setup guides in tutorial 2.5.
